  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://chirpneighbors.local/contracts/environment-controls-v1.schema.json",
  "description": "Transient illustrative scene environment structural boundary. Controls are temporary owner previews, never saved-yard or backup extensions. Frames reuse the existing weather epoch, day length, seed and caller clock; lighting is illustrative, not regional astronomy. Resolver and transition semantics enforce neutral unconfigured providers, shared-clock derivation, bounded smooth blends and stable particle anchors. No location, live weather, observations, provider execution, biological claims or public sharing authority."
}
